label chapter_one:

    scene bg school_hallway at bg_fit with dissolve

    thought "Okay. I ran."
    thought "I am not proud of it but I ran and I have zero regrets."
    thought "Current status: hiding behind a vending machine on the second floor."
    thought "This is fine. This is a completely normal first day of school."

    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    "A pair of shoes stopped right in front of the vending machine."

    show sarasmilequiet at right_char with dissolve

    sara "...You ran pretty fast for someone in dress shoes."
    soo "I was not running. I was walking with urgency."
    sara "You knocked over a first year."
    soo "He'll recover."

    thought "She's doing that thing again where she looks at me like I'm a stray cat she adopted."
    thought "I don't like it."
    thought "Stop being pretty and judge me like a normal person."

    show sarasmiletalk at right_char
    sara "The opening ceremony starts in ten minutes."
    hide sarasmiletalk
    show sarasmilequiet at right_char
    soo "I know."
    sara "You're hiding behind a vending machine."
    soo "I'm AWARE, Sara."

    show woosmile at left_char with dissolve

    woo "Oh! There you are, Soo-ah!"
    woo "We were looking everywhere for you!"
    soo "How did you even find me."
    woo "Sara said you'd be somewhere weird."

    show sarasmiletalk at right_char
    sara "I said she'd be somewhere quiet."
    hide sarasmiletalk
    show sarasmilequiet at right_char

    thought "That's somehow worse."

    show minhoquiet at left_char with dissolve
    hide woosmile

    minho "Ceremony. Now."
    soo "..."
    soo "Yeah okay."

    thought "Four words. A new record."

    hide minhoquiet
    hide sarasmilequiet
    hide sooneutralquiet

    return
